  message: "VALIDATED by directed cohort 2026-08-02 — tag stripped (moved). True A/B on identical inputs: same 9 repos at the same checkouts, same claims YAML, same runner, only the output dir differs; an instrument check asserting both directions of the fix ran before any measurement. Positive control fires (114 of 321 before-arm flows have an ambiguous short-name sink). Result on INV-karud's own realizability probe: non-realizable 51 -> 43, i.e. exactly the 8 substring matches removed, 0 flows ADDED. All five named defects gone, checked by name. One removal was NOT a filed defect and is a genuine loss: pretix defusedcsv.writer, reached before only by the 'csv' in 'defusedcsv' coincidence — filed as WI-nibav, fix is a catalog entry rather than a looser predicate. CORRECTION recorded on the residual item: this filing attributed d3's log (the logarithm) to substring matching; it was never a substring defect and is STILL PRESENT, matched via the no-module-hint path. Scope-axis error (L1)."  # 0747
